## Why This Is Asked
Reasoning about testing data pipelines, CI/CD, rollback, and maintainability without affecting prod.

## Key Concepts
- Test harness, Spark validation, PyTest integration, synthetic data, lineage, masking, CI.

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-test harness outline
function validateRecordSchema(record) {
  const required = ['id','ts','payload'];
  for (const k of required) {
    if (!(k in record) || record[k] == null) return false;
  }
  return true;
}
```

